WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.122
Quickly and easily reduce your infrastructure costs by at least sixty percent.

00:00:05.042 --> 00:00:06.665
Stop wasting energy!

00:00:06.665 --> 00:00:09.695
Upstairs and downstairs, all eight lights are on.

00:00:10.625 --> 00:00:12.173
The family leaves.

00:00:12.173 --> 00:00:13.528
Every window stays bright.

00:00:14.458 --> 00:00:16.914
Eight lamps burn for eight empty hours.

00:00:16.914 --> 00:00:19.645
That's ninety-six cents to light an empty house.

00:00:20.583 --> 00:00:22.701
Put good habits into practice.

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:24.932
The last person switches off the lights.

00:00:24.932 --> 00:00:27.400
Same eight hours, zero cents.

00:00:28.333 --> 00:00:29.657
Someone comes home.

00:00:29.657 --> 00:00:30.968
Only their room lights up.

00:00:31.875 --> 00:00:36.493
SlimFaas automates your best practices and switches idle pods off for you!

00:00:36.493 --> 00:00:38.163
Each window is a pod.

00:00:38.163 --> 00:00:40.594
SlimFaas is the front door for requests.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:46.847
At ten euros per pod-hour, eight idle pods cost eighty euros in one hour.

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:51.683
After the idle timeout, SlimFaas scales the app to zero.

00:00:51.683 --> 00:00:53.970
Another quiet hour adds zero euros.

00:00:54.875 --> 00:00:56.991
One request wakes a pod.

00:00:56.991 --> 00:00:58.707
More requests light up the house.

00:00:59.625 --> 00:01:01.433
Demand keeps climbing.

00:01:01.433 --> 00:01:03.411
Eight windows become thirty-two.

00:01:04.333 --> 00:01:06.198
Now picture Versailles.

00:01:06.198 --> 00:01:09.608
Thousands of messages come through the same front door.

00:01:09.608 --> 00:01:11.158
Ninety-six windows light up.

00:01:12.083 --> 00:01:15.549
Try SlimFaas in five minutes with your existing HTTP app.

00:01:15.549 --> 00:01:17.033
Keep your language and your handler.

00:01:17.958 --> 00:01:20.119
Perfect for your agentic apps!

00:01:20.119 --> 00:01:23.793
Stream files, cache results, and publish events.

00:01:23.793 --> 00:01:27.112
Replay streams, queue jobs, and trace requests.

00:01:27.112 --> 00:01:29.922
All over HTTP, without an SDK.

00:01:30.833 --> 00:01:31.976
Take this example.

00:01:31.976 --> 00:01:36.802
At sixty percent, a ten-thousand-euro monthly bill drops to four thousand.

00:01:36.802 --> 00:01:39.131
That's six thousand euros saved each month.

00:01:40.042 --> 00:01:44.401
Incredible, over twelve months you save seventy-two thousand euros!

00:01:44.401 --> 00:01:45.930
Give SlimFaas a try.

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:48.686
Help keep my home on the ice!

00:01:48.686 --> 00:01:50.518
This isn’t Versailles, you know!
